{"title":"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Erin receives $3 a day. How many days will it take Erin to receive a total of $30?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b902c0caa7b8c05f335b64d90b21f1051b7acfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 14 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 27 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Erin receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831d26f39684cd7cfa4ae5f2a0098b432dc8a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> a day, it takes Erin <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/4/674a32e02f6aef1385fd7eb8b2c7febce7d30b7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$30}{\\$3} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"121\" height=\"41\" /> days to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3493ed3e65fc639c760d4739aa3fb72ee444fff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> in total.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> 